[manifest]
desc="Prometheus exporter for hardware and OS metrics exposed by *NIX kernels, written in Go with pluggable metric collectors.<br>Listens on port 9100 by default.<br>Security notice: configure firewalls, port forwarding, and access authorization carefully. Improper configuration may expose host performance metrics, hardware status, and some runtime environment information.<br>For usage instructions, see the <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter/">official documentation</a>.<br>This software package is provided by community users and is maintained by them."
